function Types([string]$Profile){switch($Profile){'empty'{$t=[type[]]@()};'object'{$t=[type[]]@([object])};'int'{$t=[type[]]@([int])};'null'{$t=$null};'nullElement'{$t=[type[]]@($null)};'twoObjects'{$t=[type[]]@([object],[object])}};return ,$t}
function Default-Kind($V){if([object]::ReferenceEquals($V,$null)){return 'null'};if($V -is [DBNull]){return 'DBNull'};return $V.GetType().FullName}
function Method($M){if([object]::ReferenceEquals($M,$null)){return $null};$p=$M.ReturnParameter;return [ordered]@{name=$M.Name;declaringType=$M.DeclaringType.FullName;reflectedType=$M.ReflectedType.FullName;returnType=$M.ReturnType.FullName;text=$M.ToString();memberType=[int]$M.MemberType;public=$M.IsPublic;private=$M.IsPrivate;family=$M.IsFamily;assembly=$M.IsAssembly;familyAndAssembly=$M.IsFamilyAndAssembly;familyOrAssembly=$M.IsFamilyOrAssembly;static=$M.IsStatic;abstract=$M.IsAbstract;virtual=$M.IsVirtual;final=$M.IsFinal;specialName=$M.IsSpecialName;constructor=$M.IsConstructor;hideBySig=$M.IsHideBySig;callingConvention=[int]$M.CallingConvention;securityCritical=$M.IsSecurityCritical;securitySafeCritical=$M.IsSecuritySafeCritical;securityTransparent=$M.IsSecurityTransparent;methodImpl=[int]$M.GetMethodImplementationFlags();bodyNull=[object]::ReferenceEquals($M.GetMethodBody(),$null);genericMethod=$M.IsGenericMethod;genericDefinition=$M.IsGenericMethodDefinition;constructedGeneric=$M.IsConstructedGenericMethod;containsGeneric=$M.ContainsGenericParameters;genericCount=$M.GetGenericArguments().Length;parameterCount=$M.GetParameters().Length;baseName=$M.GetBaseDefinition().Name;baseOwner=$M.GetBaseDefinition().DeclaringType.FullName;returnParameter=[ordered]@{nameUnits=$(if([object]::ReferenceEquals($p.Name,$null)){$null}else{,[int[]][char[]]$p.Name});position=$p.Position;type=$p.ParameterType.FullName;optional=$p.IsOptional;hasDefault=$p.HasDefaultValue;defaultKind=(Default-Kind $p.DefaultValue);rawDefaultKind=(Default-Kind $p.RawDefaultValue);isIn=$p.IsIn;isOut=$p.IsOut;isRetval=$p.IsRetval;isLcid=$p.IsLcid;attributes=[int]$p.Attributes;optionalModifiers=$p.GetOptionalCustomModifiers().Length;requiredModifiers=$p.GetRequiredCustomModifiers().Length;memberName=$p.Member.Name;text=$p.ToString()}}}
function Failure($Record){$e=$Record.Exception;while($e -is [Reflection.TargetInvocationException] -or $e -is [Management.Automation.MethodInvocationException]){$e=$e.InnerException};return [ordered]@{ok=$false;exception=$e.GetType().FullName;messageUnits=[int[]][char[]]$e.Message;hResult=$e.HResult;paramName=$(if($e -is [ArgumentException]){$e.ParamName}else{$null})}}
$rows=[Collections.Generic.List[object]]::new()
function Capture([string]$Route,$Name,[int]$Flags=20,[string]$Types='empty',[int]$MemberMask=8){
 $f=[Enum]::ToObject([Reflection.BindingFlags],$Flags);$arguments=[object[]]@();$methodName='';$signature=[type[]]@();$single=$false
 switch($Route){
 'named'{$methodName='GetMethod';$signature=[type[]]@([string]);$arguments=[object[]]::new(1);$arguments[0]=$Name;$single=$true}
 'flagged'{$methodName='GetMethod';$signature=[type[]]@([string],[Reflection.BindingFlags]);$arguments=[object[]]::new(2);$arguments[0]=$Name;$arguments[1]=$f;$single=$true}
 'typed'{$methodName='GetMethod';$signature=[type[]]@([string],[type[]]);$arguments=[object[]]::new(2);$arguments[0]=$Name;$arguments[1]=(Types $Types);$single=$true}
 'flaggedTyped'{$methodName='GetMethod';$signature=[type[]]@([string],[Reflection.BindingFlags],[type[]]);$arguments=[object[]]::new(3);$arguments[0]=$Name;$arguments[1]=$f;$arguments[2]=(Types $Types);$single=$true}
 'member'{$methodName='GetMember';$signature=[type[]]@([string]);$arguments=[object[]]::new(1);$arguments[0]=$Name}
 'flaggedMember'{$methodName='GetMember';$signature=[type[]]@([string],[Reflection.BindingFlags]);$arguments=[object[]]::new(2);$arguments[0]=$Name;$arguments[1]=$f}
 'filteredMember'{$methodName='GetMember';$signature=[type[]]@([string],[Reflection.MemberTypes],[Reflection.BindingFlags]);$arguments=[object[]]::new(3);$arguments[0]=$Name;$arguments[1]=[Enum]::ToObject([Reflection.MemberTypes],$MemberMask);$arguments[2]=$f}
 'members'{$methodName='GetMembers'}
 'flaggedMembers'{$methodName='GetMembers';$signature=[type[]]@([Reflection.BindingFlags]);$arguments=[object[]]@($f)}
 'methods'{$methodName='GetMethods'}
 'flaggedMethods'{$methodName='GetMethods';$signature=[type[]]@([Reflection.BindingFlags]);$arguments=[object[]]@($f)}
 'defaults'{$methodName='GetDefaultMembers'}
 }
 try{$m=[type].GetMethod($methodName,$signature);if([object]::ReferenceEquals($m,$null)){throw 'Missing reflection harness overload'};$value=$m.Invoke($target,$arguments);if($single){$result=[ordered]@{ok=$true;kind='method';value=(Method $value)}}else{$items=@();foreach($item in $value){$items+=@(Method $item)};$result=[ordered]@{ok=$true;kind='array';value=$items}}}catch{$result=Failure $_}
 $rows.Add([ordered]@{route=$Route;nameUnits=$(if([object]::ReferenceEquals($Name,$null)){$null}else{,[int[]][char[]]$Name});flags=$Flags;types=$Types;memberMask=$MemberMask;result=$result})
}
foreach($name in $names){Capture 'named' $name;Capture 'member' $name;foreach($types in $typeProfiles){Capture 'typed' $name 20 $types};foreach($f in $flags){Capture 'flagged' $name $f;Capture 'flaggedMember' $name $f;foreach($types in $typeProfiles){Capture 'flaggedTyped' $name $f $types};foreach($mask in $memberMasks){Capture 'filteredMember' $name $f 'empty' $mask}}}
Capture 'members' $null;Capture 'methods' $null;Capture 'defaults' $null;foreach($f in $flags){Capture 'flaggedMembers' $null $f;Capture 'flaggedMethods' $null $f}
if($rows.Count -ne 2723){throw "Wrong reflection matrix: $($rows.Count)"}
$record=[ordered]@{schemaVersion=1;runtimeVersion=[Environment]::Version.ToString();coreLibSha256=$coreHash;oracleSha256=(Get-FileHash -LiteralPath $PSCommandPath -Algorithm SHA256).Hash.ToLowerInvariant();culture='Invariant';flags=$flags;typeProfiles=$typeProfiles;memberMasks=$memberMasks;rows=$rows.ToArray();qualification='SELECTED_ICLONEABLE_PARAMETERLESS_CLONE_LOOKUP_AND_DESCRIPTOR_METADATA_ONLY; INVOCATION_HANDLES_TOKENS_CUSTOM_ATTRIBUTES_FULL_REFLECTION_AND_TASK_ACCEPTANCE_OPEN'};[IO.File]::WriteAllText($OutputPath,($record|ConvertTo-Json -Depth 28 -Compress)+"`n",[Text.UTF8Encoding]::new($false));Write-Output 'PASS ICloneable member reference: 2723 lookup/metadata cases'
